<title>USA: S&amp;P ups Spartanburg County, S.C., GOs to AA-minus.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P ups Spartanburg County, S.C., GOs to AA-minus.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said Friday it raised its ratings on Spartanburg County, S.C., general obligation bonds to AA-minus from A-plus.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it assigned its AA-minus rating to the county GO bonds Series 1997.</p>
<p>The outlook is revised to stable from positive.</p>
<p>The upgrade reflects the county's continued, steady economic and employment expansion, coupled with strong financial performance and manageable growth related debt needs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
